# Admin > Reports > Clients: who uses which Orknux client.

extend type Query {
    "Every person's Orknux clients - the Chrome extension, Orknux for Windows and for Linux, Orknux Shell, the Claude Code plugin - with when each was first and last seen. Installation administrators only."
    clientUses: [ClientUse!]!
}

type ClientUse {
    username: String!
    "The person's display name, where the server knows one."
    displayName: String
    "BROWSER, DESKTOP, CLAUDE or SHELL: the door it comes in by."
    kind: String!
    "What it calls itself: Chrome, Windows, Linux, Shell."
    client: String
    "Which copy of it, where a person runs several, such as Linux on studio."
    name: String!
    version: String
    "The computer: a desktop client's own name for it, otherwise the system it runs on (Windows, macOS, Linux), where that is known."
    computer: String
    firstSeen: String!
    lastSeen: String!
    "Connected to this server now."
    connected: Boolean!
}
